@startuml
title SwapCampus 核心实体子图：商品交易

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam packageBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam classBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 80

hide methods
top to bottom direction

package "商品发布" {
  class "用户" as User {
    +用户ID
    +昵称
    +信用分
  }

  class "商品" as Product {
    +商品ID
    +标题
    +价格
    +状态
  }

  class "商品图片" as ProductImage {
    +图片ID
    +图片地址
  }
}

package "交易履约" {
  class "订单" as Order {
    +订单ID
    +状态
    +交易地点
  }

  class "评价" as Review {
    +评价ID
    +评分
  }

  class "申诉" as Appeal {
    +申诉ID
    +原因
    +状态
  }
}

User -[hidden]down- Product
Product -[hidden]down- Order
Order -[hidden]down- Review
Review -[hidden]down- Appeal
Product -[hidden]right- ProductImage

User "1" -down- "0..*" Product : 发布
Product "1" -down- "0..*" Order : 生成订单
User "1" -[norank]right- "0..*" Order : 买家 / 卖家
Product "1" -right- "1..*" ProductImage : 包含
Order "1" -down- "0..*" Review : 产生评价
Order "1" -down- "0..*" Appeal : 发起申诉

note bottom of User
收藏、行为记录等
辅助实体在本图省略。
end note

note right of Order
订单连接商品与用户。
同一用户既可能是买家，
也可能是卖家。
评价与申诉都围绕订单展开。
end note

@enduml
